          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原网络 \"%@\" 为自定义网络，未自动重建，请按需手动添加。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Original network \"%@\" is custom and was not recreated. Add it manually if needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "端口冲突：若原容器仍占用这些端口，请先停止它或修改端口后再部署。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Port conflicts: if the original container still occupies these ports, stop it or change the ports before deploying."
          }
