      }
    },
    "检查提示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Review notes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这是根据容器信息尽力还原的草稿，部分设置无法完全复原，部署前请检查。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a best-effort draft from container inspection. Not all settings can be reproduced; review before deploying."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重建容器时，匿名卷以及未挂载路径中的数据不会保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anonymous volumes and data outside mounted paths are NOT preserved when the container is recreated."
          }
        }
