            "value": "Edit container"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "编辑容器需要重建它。未挂载路径中的数据（例如未挂载出来的数据库目录）将永久丢失，已挂载的卷会保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Editing a container requires recreating it. Data outside mounted paths (e.g. an unmounted database directory) will be permanently lost. Mounted volumes are preserved."
