    "停止该项目下的所有容器并删除其 Compose 文件，此操作不可撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stops all containers in the project and deletes its compose file. This cannot be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点按服务可打开其容器详情。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap a service to open its container details."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "容器将被停止、备份，并按新设置重建。若创建失败，原容器会自动恢复。未挂载路径中的数据将丢失。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The container will be stopped, backed up and recreated with the new settings. If creation fails, the original is restored. Data outside mounted paths will be lost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原容器配置了健康检查，表单不会还原它。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The original container had a health check; it is not restored by the form."
          }
        }
      }
