    "已保存": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saved"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从编排项目保存的模板。点按可编辑并部署，点垃圾桶图标可删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Templates saved from compose projects. Tap to edit and deploy, swipe or tap trash to remove."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将当前编排配置保存为可复用模板，可在「编排模板」里找到它。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save this compose configuration as a reusable template. Find it under Compose templates."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "模板已保存，打开「编排模板」即可使用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Template saved. Open Compose templates to use it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法展开编排配置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Failed to render compose config"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "变量将展开为当前实际值并保存为快照，从该模板部署即可还原当前配置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Variables will be resolved to current values and saved as a snapshot. Deploying from it recreates this setup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "模板已保存为快照，变量已展开为实际值，部署即可还原当前配置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Template saved as a snapshot with variables resolved. Deploying it recreates the current setup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法展开变量，已改为保存原始配置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not resolve variables; saved the original configuration instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"%@\" 无法在线预览，将下载后打开系统分享面板。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"%@\" cannot be previewed online. It will be downloaded and opened in the Share sheet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 失败：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ failed: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 失败：服务器拒绝了该操作": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ failed: server refused the operation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已存在 id 为「%@」的语言包。导入将替换它及已保存的译文。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A language pack with id \"%@\" already exists. Importing will replace it and its saved translations."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「以此容器新建编排项目」会创建新项目和容器，原容器保持不变。部署前请先调整端口冲突。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create compose project creates a new project and container; the original stays untouched. Adjust port conflicts before deploying."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以此容器新建编排项目": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create compose project from this container"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "确定删除连接「%@」吗？钥匙串中保存的密码也会一并移除，远程数据库本身不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete connection \"%@\"? Its saved password in Keychain will also be removed. The remote database itself is not affected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除连接？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete connection?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "对此类数据库，重命名会新建库、迁移所有表后删除原库。请在下一步确认中仔细核对。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For this database type, renaming creates a new database, moves all tables, then drops the original. Review the confirmation before proceeding."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "前往此目录": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Go to This Directory"
          }
        }
      }
