      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "New compose project"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还没有命令记录。打开「容器」或「镜像」分区刷新一次即可。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No command records yet. Open the Containers or Images section to refresh once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开终端；可拖动调整位置": {
      "localizations": {
