        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Overwrite"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "覆盖语言包？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Overwrite Language Pack?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Redis 使用固定的数据库索引；点按索引可浏览键。若要清空某个库，请在「运行 SQL / 命令」页执行 FLUSHDB。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Redis uses fixed DB indexes; tap an index to browse keys. To clear a database, use the Run SQL / command page with FLUSHDB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "移除本机保存的「%@」登录信息？随时可以重新登录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove the saved login for \"%@\" from this server? You can log in again anytime."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仍然运行": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Run anyway"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "运行破坏性命令？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Run destructive command?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此命令可能修改或删除数据，且不可撤销。确认无误后再运行。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This command may modify or delete data and cannot be undone. Run it only if you are sure."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此操作会新建库、迁移所有表后删除原库。中途失败可能导致两个库中都残留数据，且无法自动回滚。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This creates a new database, moves all tables, then drops the original. A failure midway can leave data in both databases. This cannot be undone automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "该语言包当前正在生效，将从本机移除，App 会切回英文。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This language pack is currently active and will be removed from this device. The App will switch back to English."
          }
        }
      }
    },
