      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create template from container"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅列出非编排创建的容器。编排容器请在编排项目详情页保存为模板。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only containers not created by Compose are listed. For Compose containers, save a template from the project detail page instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有找到非编排创建的容器。": {
      "localizations": {
